## Intro
I want this to be a force analysis of a drop-track section for a KUKA coaster and a roller coaster. I will make separate models for each, but they are the same system. From there, I want to expand to a motion-base drop track, or a motion-platform drop track, for a coaster, but that is still to be determined. The drop will be faster than the KUKA arm's rate, so there is an intrinsic purpose to the drop track, other than novelty. It will also allow the ride to exist on two separate levels, which can let me do a really cool effect for the riders.
